{"id":"2a0857f94280c847fbde0f775b6e39896f18ab67","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1255040","title":"怎么 b 站现在好多视频的评论区都是 deepseek 的机器人在评论， id 都是什么大肥鱼，小鲸鱼等等，有时候机器人还会艾特另外一个机器人，两个机器人还能聊起来，数量之多，已经快要刷屏了，正常用户的评论都看不见了，这合理么？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"xtx","excerpt":"哔哩哔哩 - @xtx -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/机器人\"><li></li> 机器人</a><a href=\"/tag/评论区\"><li></li> 评论区</a><a href=\"/tag/刷屏\"><li></li> 刷屏</a></P><p><span>16 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-07 09:12:40 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18264961\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bc70/20b5/500658_normal.png?m=1740134169\" alt=\"kyro00000\" data-uid=\"500658\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>3</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>x 上都是惊天言论.. 哪里有过滤 AI 发言的机器啊?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265197\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3907/99d0/111998_normal.png?m=1790156253\" alt=\"flyico\" data-uid=\"111998\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>4</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>他们这些是用的什么实现的？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265328\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_normal.png?m=1793929783\" alt=\"dumbass\" data-uid=\"130918\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>7</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>妈的，x 的评论区都是各种 AI 回复， 看得我头皮发麻</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265355\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/55579e415f3d312d5b8905b3b9ec0761?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"longaiwp\" data-uid=\"139260\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>8</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>不是很正常吗？就是有这样的插件，小朋友们爱玩。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265526\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/416930a1d63dccf1ae1e4c05f3c5f578?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"v21984\" data-uid=\"600745\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>10</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>真无语，社区应该是人与人之间交流的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265535\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e46/6c99/372530_normal.png?m=1751365665\" alt=\"duanxianze\" data-uid=\"372530\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>11</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>也就这一阵子，过段时间就好了，就跟什么华强买瓜一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265569\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>12</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>基本上是在 ai 相关视频下刷屏，尤其是 llm 相关的网红区。<br>反正我看到满屏的这种 id 的视频是没有任何兴趣评论的，都不说他们那些评论高度相似和味大，我要看 ai 评论用的着看你的么，b 站不管就是变相杀死社区</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265618\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0e9506d98efb4d9d9a24671511108232?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"YJMe\" data-uid=\"624837\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/YJMe\">YJMe</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-06 22:12:25 +08:00\">15h 34m ago via iPhone</span><span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\">1</span></p></div>\n                    <p><span>13</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>试着想象一下，这篇帖子也是 AI 自动发的，楼上也都是 AI 自动评论的，都相互聊起来了，我也是 AI</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265634\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/00d1b0a8010d28b6912bfd4cb999756f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xue777hua\" data-uid=\"66054\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>14</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/livid\">livid</a> 建议 在“时间线”页面 针对 title 过长的帖子 进行 ellipsis 处理</p><p>否则比如这篇帖子 影响观感。独占好几倍垂直空间。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18265935\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fb4ba999ead9b0e771305db6d39e895b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"loverppc\" data-uid=\"136249\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>15</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>微信公众号也很多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18266055\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0885e8dd206903a6a4acdaa194b7cd8d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mosfet\" data-uid=\"281891\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>16</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>能有 id 特征表明自己是 AI 已经算好了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"机器人 评论区 刷屏16 replies • 2026-11-07 09:12:40 +08:00 3 x 上都是惊天言论.. 哪里有过滤 AI 发言的机器啊? 4 他们这些是用的什么实现的？ 7 妈的，x 的评论区都是各种 AI 回复， 看得我头皮发麻 8 不是很正常吗？就是有这样的插件，小朋友们爱玩。 10 真无语，社区应该是人与人之间交流的 11 也就这一阵子，过段时间就好了，就跟什么华强买瓜一样 12 基本上是在 ai 相关视频下刷屏，尤其是 llm 相关的网红区。反正我看到满屏的这种 id 的视频是没有任何兴趣评论的，都不说他们那些评论高度相似和味大，我要看 ai 评论用的着看你的么，b 站不管